{
  "node_type": "statement",
  "body": {
    "id": "thm:local-panel-minimax",
    "kind": "theorem",
    "statement": "For every \\(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{opt}}>0\\), there exists a sequence \\(\\{\\widetilde C_n^{(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{opt}})}\\}\\in\\mathfrak H^{\\mathrm{panel}}_{1-\\alpha}(\\theta_0,v_0;M,L_0)\\) such that \\(\\limsup_{n\\to\\infty}\\sup_{u\\in\\mathcal U}\\mathbb E_{P_{\\theta_n(u)}}[\\sup_{t\\in\\mathcal D}\\sqrt n\\,\\operatorname{diam}\\widetilde C_n^{(\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{opt}})}(v_n(t))]\\le L_\\alpha(\\theta_0,v_0;M,L_0)+\\varepsilon_{\\mathrm{opt}}\\). Conversely, for every generic sequence \\(\\{\\widetilde C_n\\}\\in\\mathfrak H^{\\mathrm{panel}}_{1-\\alpha}(\\theta_0,v_0;M,L_0)\\), \\(\\liminf_{n\\to\\infty}\\sup_{u\\in\\mathcal U}\\mathbb E_{P_{\\theta_n(u)}}[\\sup_{t\\in\\mathcal D}\\sqrt n\\,\\operatorname{diam}\\widetilde C_n(v_n(t))]\\ge L_\\alpha(\\theta_0,v_0;M,L_0)\\). There exists a diagonal sequence in this honesty class for which the limit equals \\(L_\\alpha(\\theta_0,v_0;M,L_0)\\), and its rules inherit the certified finite upper and lower decision bounds. These quantifiers do not refer to the global projection band \\(C_n\\), for which no global minimax claim is made.",
    "free_symbols": [
      "varepsilonopt",
      "CtildeN",
      "PanelBandClass",
      "n",
